---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: stdout(&output)
---
comment/agent-artifact error on Agent chatter about its plan, spec or past edits
comment/narrative warn on Comment narrates what the code does
comment/section-divider warn on Decorative section divider comment
comment/step-numbered warn on Numbered step or phase header comment
comment/untracked-todo info on TODO, FIXME, HACK or XXX without an issue reference
debug/leftover warn on Debug output or breakpoint left in library code
error/redundant-rethrow warn on Catch that only rethrows the same error
error/swallowed error on Error handler that hides the failure
sec/hardcoded-secret error on Hardcoded API key, token or private key
stub/placeholder-body warn on Function body left as a placeholder
test/tautological error on Test assertion that always passes
text/invisible-unicode error on Zero-width or bidi control character
ts/unsafe-assertion warn on Type assertion to any, or a double assertion through unknown
